From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Razoc <razoc@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:04:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 39/51] feat(akibot): AMD FSR 3.1 upscaling in place of the
 game's temporal upscale

AKIBOT_FSR=1 (build with KYTY_FFX_SDK_DIR = AMD FidelityFX SDK 1.1.4;
amd_fidelityfx_vk.dll next to the game) replaces the same pass as DLSS,
with the same inputs (ReadPass: both game versions), jitter and motion
vector conventions. Near, far and vertical field of view come from the
game's projection (NoteFrameGenCamera).

FSR asks the device for some core functions by their old KHR names
(vkGetBufferMemoryRequirements2KHR) and calls them unchecked: the
backend's vkGetDeviceProcAddr wrapper gives the core function instead
and logs the ones still missing.

In-game menu: "Upscaling" adds AMD FSR 3.1.

Checked in Sky Garden (01.007.000): FSR 1920x1080 -> 2432x1368 on every
frame, 59-60 FPS, picture clean.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
